WEBVTT

00:00:01.430 --> 00:00:04.030
<i>The year is 2205 A.D.</i>

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:13.490
<i>To annihilate the History Retrograde 
Army, who scheme to alter history,</i>

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:17.150
<i>we, who were born from swords,</i>

00:00:17.890 --> 00:00:20.580
<i>engage in mortal combat today as well!</i>

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:43.370
<b>Touken Ranbu </b>Hanamaru<b></b>

00:01:56.470 --> 00:01:59.330
"This anime is about the 
stories of the Hanamaru days

00:01:59.330 --> 00:02:04.210
of a certain group of Sword 
Warriors in a certain citadel."

00:02:12.940 --> 00:02:14.320
43 - Naginata
 <b>Iwatooshi</b>

00:02:13.960 --> 00:02:15.820
Here I go!

00:02:15.820 --> 00:02:16.390
Fly!

00:02:17.230 --> 00:02:18.560
Charge!

00:02:23.380 --> 00:02:24.770
Yamatonokami-dono!

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:29.420
Are you okay?

00:02:31.400 --> 00:02:32.660
The same dream?

00:02:32.850 --> 00:02:35.320
Yes, I had it again this morning.

00:02:36.110 --> 00:02:39.170
The dream where the Shinsengumi 
are storming the Ikeda Inn.

00:02:39.990 --> 00:02:45.040
Each time, he goes up to the second 
floor, and I'm the sword he's wearing.

00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:48.410
But in reality, it was Kashuu-san, right?

00:02:48.720 --> 00:02:52.200
Right. It's a strange dream 
that's different from history.

00:02:54.240 --> 00:02:56.940
What's with the dark expression?

00:02:56.940 --> 00:02:58.860
That hurt, Iwatooshi!

00:02:58.860 --> 00:03:02.520
Only in your dreams are you 
freely able to change history.

00:03:04.450 --> 00:03:07.820
I often have the same dream
 as well, in that case.

00:03:08.520 --> 00:03:11.650
Even though I was Lord 
Yoshitsune's protector sword,

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:15.630
I wasn't able to protect him.

00:03:17.380 --> 00:03:21.290
Imanotsurugi, it's all in 
the past. Forget about it.

00:03:22.930 --> 00:03:25.050
Now that I'm here, everything's fine.

00:03:25.840 --> 00:03:27.980
I won't let you feel alone anymore.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:29.600
Yes!

00:03:30.790 --> 00:03:33.070
Everyone, get ready to be dispatched.

00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:34.520
Dispatched?

00:03:38.620 --> 00:03:41.300
The fried tofu smells wonderful.

00:03:41.300 --> 00:03:44.250
Nakigitsune, let me have one, too.

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:47.410
Bon appétit!

00:03:49.790 --> 00:03:54.660
Since you made so many, we should 
share them with that other man.

00:03:54.830 --> 00:03:56.910
Yes, we'll eat them together.

00:03:57.080 --> 00:04:00.160
My, my, for you to be making these yourself,

00:04:00.160 --> 00:04:03.690
Nakigitsune, you must really like him.

00:04:03.800 --> 00:04:05.600
It's because we're both foxes.

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:11.200
Today is another good day.

00:04:14.150 --> 00:04:16.440
You're as meticulous as ever.

00:04:17.060 --> 00:04:19.940
44 - Tachi 
<b>Kogitsunemaru</b>

00:04:17.220 --> 00:04:20.130
Master said that they liked my hair.

00:04:20.380 --> 00:04:23.600
Oh, so did Master give you that comb?

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:26.500
It makes it increasingly glossier.

00:04:27.070 --> 00:04:28.810
That's good.

00:04:28.990 --> 00:04:32.990
And everyone seems rather
chummy with you, too, Mikazuki-dono.

00:04:33.110 --> 00:04:36.660
You just sit on the porch and 
someone will take care of you.

00:04:37.520 --> 00:04:39.470
Everyone is very kind.

00:04:40.010 --> 00:04:41.990
Bringing me tea,

00:04:42.450 --> 00:04:44.400
massaging my shoulders,

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:47.890
and letting me hold tigers 
when it gets cold.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:51.560
So, I wonder who will come by today.

00:04:52.350 --> 00:04:54.020
If it's spicy, it's a miss?

00:04:55.290 --> 00:04:58.070
I'm not a shishitou pepper, I'm Shishiou!

00:05:00.040 --> 00:05:02.270
A big sword has come today.

00:05:02.270 --> 00:05:03.520
I'm not big!

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:08.010
The man who used to wield me was an 
old man named Minamoto no Yorimasa.

00:05:08.530 --> 00:05:13.120
So I'm a sword that was made lighter, so that 
even old people could wield me easily.

00:05:13.370 --> 00:05:16.710
Then Shishiou was made 
with the elderly in mind.

00:05:16.710 --> 00:05:20.100
Yep, I'm used to taking care of the elderly.

00:05:21.990 --> 00:05:24.380
Will you look after me, then?

00:05:28.170 --> 00:05:30.780
What's that? It smells delicious.

00:05:31.460 --> 00:05:37.500
Everyone, Nakigitsune said that he wishes
 to eat inari zushi with you, if you please.

00:05:37.500 --> 00:05:39.520
Oh, it's my favorite.

00:05:40.010 --> 00:05:41.930
You made these, Nakigitsune?

00:05:42.220 --> 00:05:45.130
Yes, they're very delicious.

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.460
Yes, delicious.

00:05:48.160 --> 00:05:50.380
Well, let's try one.

00:05:50.380 --> 00:05:52.240
That's the biggest one.

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:56.140
They're inari zushi for
adults made with wasabi.

00:05:53.320 --> 00:05:55.600
Hm? This is...

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:58.760
Mikazuki-dono?

00:06:00.860 --> 00:06:03.290
That surprised me a little bit.

00:06:03.590 --> 00:06:05.090
You must be exaggerating.

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:07.310
B-By a lot, too.

00:06:12.460 --> 00:06:15.480
Nakigitsune! Nakigitsune!

00:06:17.290 --> 00:06:20.820
Nakigitsune is good at taking 
care of the elderly.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:24.500
Shishiou?

00:06:25.090 --> 00:06:27.060
I just remembered something I needed to do!

00:06:33.770 --> 00:06:35.020
Tsurumaru!

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.240
What is it, all of a sudden?

00:06:38.360 --> 00:06:40.730
I can't be beaten when it comes
to taking care of the elderly.

00:06:40.730 --> 00:06:42.200
I want to borrow your wisdom.

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.030
What are you talking about?

00:06:44.750 --> 00:06:47.240
It's boring just to serve 
up the same old thing.

00:06:47.720 --> 00:06:49.290
What we need...

00:06:49.960 --> 00:06:51.270
...is a surprise!

00:06:53.500 --> 00:06:56.110
I'm in. Who's the target?

00:06:56.110 --> 00:06:57.630
It's definitely Mikazuki.

00:06:57.630 --> 00:06:59.780
That's pretty crafty.

00:06:59.780 --> 00:07:01.850
He lacks nothing as a target.

00:07:01.960 --> 00:07:05.110
But how should we surprise him?

00:07:07.790 --> 00:07:09.790
A great sword warrior?

00:07:10.640 --> 00:07:15.450
He'd be cool, strong, friendly, 
refined, and independent.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:18.540
In other words, a super sword 
warrior to surpass all others.

00:07:18.540 --> 00:07:20.310
A super sword warrior?!

00:07:20.310 --> 00:07:21.320
That's right.

00:07:21.320 --> 00:07:24.290
Mikazuki won't be able to stand 
the shock of seeing that.

00:07:25.240 --> 00:07:28.400
The problem is finding someone 
to be that sword warrior.

00:07:28.400 --> 00:07:30.700
No one but you could do that, though!

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.610
I'm going to go look for helpers.

00:07:39.650 --> 00:07:40.960
Me?

00:07:45.280 --> 00:07:47.340
Hachisuka is in charge of the costume.

00:07:47.420 --> 00:07:49.420
Kiyomitsu is in charge of the nails.

00:07:49.480 --> 00:07:51.720
Midare is in charge of etiquette.

00:07:51.720 --> 00:07:52.820
Etiquette?

00:07:52.940 --> 00:07:57.020
Why do I have to take part 
in something like this?

00:07:57.190 --> 00:08:02.220
It's pointless if he doesn't look like a 
super sword warrior to surpass all others,

00:08:02.220 --> 00:08:06.270
meaning I'd like to acquire 
your aesthetic sense, Hachisuka.

00:08:07.030 --> 00:08:08.240
I'm doing his nails?

00:08:08.350 --> 00:08:13.840
A super sword warrior should 
lead with flashy fingernails first.

00:08:14.750 --> 00:08:16.020
I see.

00:08:16.020 --> 00:08:19.060
And Midare, I'd like for you 
to teach him some etiquette.

00:08:19.060 --> 00:08:20.890
What do you mean by etiquette?

00:08:20.890 --> 00:08:23.990
I mean that I want him to have 
an eccentric personality.

00:08:23.990 --> 00:08:26.610
You know some strange words, don't you?

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:28.920
If I recall, they're from 
about 200 years ago.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:32.660
You mean those words that were 
in the magazine Master gave me!

00:08:32.800 --> 00:08:35.240
I want to really surprise Mikazuki!

00:08:35.240 --> 00:08:38.560
Please, make Shishiou into 
a super sword warrior.

00:08:38.820 --> 00:08:41.960
Right, I'll make the best 
super sword warrior.

00:08:43.440 --> 00:08:45.690
When you put it that way, 
I guess we have to.

00:08:46.280 --> 00:08:49.860
Very well, we'll show him 
something other than a fake.

00:08:51.480 --> 00:08:53.990
If you're going to do this, 
you have to go all the way.

00:08:53.990 --> 00:08:55.680
I'll give it all I've got!

00:08:55.680 --> 00:08:56.690
I'm counting on you!

00:08:56.690 --> 00:08:59.160
Now, let's go gather what we need!

00:09:23.210 --> 00:09:24.440
"Wanchan."

00:09:24.620 --> 00:09:26.230
I know that one! A puppy (<i>wanchan</i>)!

00:09:26.420 --> 00:09:29.320
"Wanchan," means you have one more chance.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:30.850
That's correct.

00:09:31.030 --> 00:09:32.450
What about "onikawa"?

00:09:32.850 --> 00:09:33.990
Demon's skin.

00:09:34.140 --> 00:09:36.650
It means to be as cute as a demon.

00:09:36.650 --> 00:09:37.920
Everyone knows that!

00:09:38.230 --> 00:09:40.610
Is there such a thing as a cute demon?

00:09:40.760 --> 00:09:43.890
As the super sword warrior, 
be sure to remember it.

00:09:44.150 --> 00:09:46.580
"Kamacho" means "please play with me."

00:09:46.580 --> 00:09:48.810
"Paripi" is "party people."

00:09:48.870 --> 00:09:52.440
And when you're happy you say, 
"majirunrun gokigenmaru."

00:09:52.620 --> 00:09:53.760
Then there's—

00:09:53.760 --> 00:09:55.040
His nails are done.

00:09:55.900 --> 00:09:58.920
I painted them like this 
with Mikazuki in mind.

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.040
Has it made him cuter?

00:10:02.830 --> 00:10:03.630
Well?

00:10:03.630 --> 00:10:05.250
It's "onikawa!"

00:10:06.890 --> 00:10:08.670
I've borrowed things from everyone.

00:10:08.740 --> 00:10:11.500
Let's adorn him gracefully with 
all of these things together.

00:10:12.130 --> 00:10:13.550
Oh, with this I'll...

00:10:13.550 --> 00:10:15.460
...become a super sword warrior.

00:10:15.700 --> 00:10:17.050
We have "wanchan."

00:10:17.050 --> 00:10:17.930
We do.

00:10:17.930 --> 00:10:19.040
"Wanchan?"

00:10:20.550 --> 00:10:25.710
Starting with the feet, the boots are 
mine, while the tunic is Horikawa's.

00:10:25.710 --> 00:10:29.180
Kashuu's coat, Nikkari's white clothing,

00:10:29.180 --> 00:10:31.830
plus Doudanuki's scarf, and Maeda's hat.

00:10:31.830 --> 00:10:33.400
What do you think of this?

00:10:33.400 --> 00:10:36.520
That's amazing, Hachisuka. 
It's better than I imagined!

00:10:36.520 --> 00:10:38.240
He looks so cool and refined!

00:10:38.240 --> 00:10:39.340
It's perfect!

00:10:39.340 --> 00:10:40.680
Am I finished?

00:10:40.680 --> 00:10:42.870
The real test is coming up.

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:45.780
Now we just need some acting 
ability to surprise him.

00:10:45.780 --> 00:10:47.150
Acting ability?

00:10:50.740 --> 00:10:52.830
Okay, are you ready?

00:10:53.100 --> 00:10:54.620
Are you ready, too, Shishiou?

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:55.540
Of course.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:57.610
That's not quite how you use it, though.

00:10:58.110 --> 00:11:00.070
All right, let's do this!

00:11:02.700 --> 00:11:04.720
What's that?

00:11:04.910 --> 00:11:07.740
I have never seen a sword
warrior like that before!

00:11:08.090 --> 00:11:09.110
What's the matter?

00:11:09.110 --> 00:11:10.280
What is it?

00:11:10.500 --> 00:11:13.250
An amazing sword warrior has manifested.

00:11:13.250 --> 00:11:14.270
What's his name?

00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:16.250
His name?

00:11:16.450 --> 00:11:18.400
Majirunrun Gokigenmaru!

00:11:18.400 --> 00:11:22.600
Yes, it's Majirunrun Gokigenmaru, 
a companion of myself and Kogitsunemaru.

00:11:22.770 --> 00:11:26.520
He's a super sword warrior
 that surpasses all others!

00:11:26.740 --> 00:11:28.660
Super sword warrior?

00:11:28.880 --> 00:11:31.300
Majirunrun Gokigenmaru?

00:11:32.300 --> 00:11:33.860
He's coming this way!

00:11:33.860 --> 00:11:35.430
This is big!

00:11:56.000 --> 00:11:57.320
UK!

00:11:59.950 --> 00:12:01.620
Don't worry about reality.

00:12:01.620 --> 00:12:03.000
UK!

00:12:03.000 --> 00:12:04.190
Don't worry about reality.

00:12:05.220 --> 00:12:07.990
He even has his own way with words!

00:12:07.990 --> 00:12:10.410
As expected of the super sword warrior.

00:12:10.590 --> 00:12:11.780
Kamacho.

00:12:12.290 --> 00:12:13.660
Kyamacho?

00:12:14.500 --> 00:12:17.600
<i>That's it! Mikazuki's totally surprised.</i>

00:12:18.190 --> 00:12:20.310
This is surprising.

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:24.660
To think that Shishitou's true desire 
was to become a super sword warrior.

00:12:25.980 --> 00:12:28.460
It's Shishiou, not Shishitou!

00:12:30.800 --> 00:12:34.180
You carried all this out 
to amuse me, didn't you?

00:12:34.990 --> 00:12:38.140
Your ability to care for the 
elderly is amazing, Shishiou.

00:12:44.030 --> 00:12:45.900
Was this a success?

00:12:45.990 --> 00:12:47.670
A huge success.

00:12:53.750 --> 00:12:55.250
UK?

00:12:56.750 --> 00:12:59.000
<b>Touken Ranbu </b>Hanamaru<b></b>

00:13:01.890 --> 00:13:03.590
What happened to your head?

00:13:03.910 --> 00:13:05.310
Are you all right?

00:13:06.000 --> 00:13:07.480
UK.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:08.770
UK?

00:13:08.980 --> 00:13:13.610
Ka, ka, ka! Brother, the time for 
us to fight together has come.

00:13:14.160 --> 00:13:15.910
I'm glad you seem happy.

00:13:16.310 --> 00:13:20.700
I wish to become stronger so
 I may laugh off everything.

00:13:20.760 --> 00:13:22.420
What will being stronger do?

00:13:22.420 --> 00:13:25.480
Well, all the fighting will be over, then.

00:13:25.480 --> 00:13:28.110
Perhaps I will return 
to being a work of art.

00:13:28.350 --> 00:13:29.770
You're so carefree.

00:13:30.120 --> 00:13:36.000
<b>Sa</b>

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:32.160
Thank you for waiting, everyone.

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:36.000
I'll read the dispatch orders Master gave me.

00:13:36.530 --> 00:13:42.400
Yamatonokami Yasusada, Imanotsurugi, 
Iwatooshi, Ishikirimaru,

00:13:42.710 --> 00:13:47.480
Yamanbagiri Kunihiro, with 
Yamabushi Kunihiro as Captain,

00:13:47.870 --> 00:13:49.760
will be dispatched.

00:13:49.930 --> 00:13:53.490
Ka, ka, ka! So, I am the captain?

00:13:53.490 --> 00:13:56.010
To lead others is also a part of studying.

00:13:56.450 --> 00:13:58.230
Though you're all from different periods,

00:13:58.230 --> 00:14:01.220
please do your best to work 
together to destroy the enemy.

00:14:01.930 --> 00:14:05.830
You are being sent to 
Atsukashiyama in the year 1189.

00:14:05.980 --> 00:14:07.610
Atsukashiyama?

00:14:09.890 --> 00:14:14.520
The History Retrograde Army wishes to 
alter the Battle of Atsukashiyama, do they?

00:14:14.660 --> 00:14:17.800
This will be my first time 
going there. Are they strong?

00:14:18.160 --> 00:14:21.410
According to Konnosuke, the enemy 
has substantial fighting ability.

00:14:21.880 --> 00:14:27.840
Master said that they wish for you to fight 
specifically with Yamatonokami Yasusada,

00:14:27.840 --> 00:14:29.620
who is used to battle, and Imanotsurugi.

00:14:30.350 --> 00:14:31.350
Let's do our best.

00:14:33.730 --> 00:14:38.000
Each of you please prepare yourselves 
and be ready to depart in 30 minutes.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:42.470
Please equip yourselves well, 
so you won't be late.

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.040
Do you have a moment?

00:14:46.500 --> 00:14:47.740
Hasebe-san?

00:14:48.420 --> 00:14:51.980
Do you know about the battle of 
Atsukashiyama, Yamatonokami?

00:14:52.560 --> 00:14:57.990
It was the battle between Imanotsurugi's
 former master, Minamoto no Yoshitsune,

00:14:57.990 --> 00:15:02.140
Minamoto no Yoritomo, his elder brother who 
ordered him killed, and Fujiwara no Yasuhira,

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.880
who had him commit seppuku.

00:15:04.360 --> 00:15:08.830
Imanotsurugi might not be able
 to maintain his calm there.

00:15:09.180 --> 00:15:12.590
Please keep an eye on him, and back him up.

00:15:12.960 --> 00:15:15.070
So that's why he made that face.

00:15:15.750 --> 00:15:19.740
Why is Master making Imanotsurugi 
go somewhere like that?

00:15:20.060 --> 00:15:22.140
It's just going to bring up painful memories.

00:15:22.670 --> 00:15:25.080
Master has their reasons.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:28.260
You were sent to the Ikeda Inn on 
your first mission, weren't you?

00:15:28.770 --> 00:15:32.150
And Souza and I were sent to Honnouji.

00:15:32.800 --> 00:15:37.100
So they hope for us to grow by 
sending us to our places of fate?

00:15:37.230 --> 00:15:38.340
Who knows?

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:42.820
It is hard to know what Master is thinking.

00:15:43.830 --> 00:15:46.880
That's true, but that's fine.

00:15:51.750 --> 00:15:53.010
Now you're ready.

00:15:53.160 --> 00:15:54.840
Please do your best, my brothers.

00:15:56.000 --> 00:15:57.830
I wish I could go, too.

00:15:57.830 --> 00:15:59.570
We'll be back soon.

00:15:59.980 --> 00:16:04.500
Now, battle is also studying. 
Let us give it all our might!

00:16:05.260 --> 00:16:06.440
Take care!

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:16.010
So this is Atsukashiyama?

00:16:16.010 --> 00:16:19.800
I would like to settle this before the 
Yoritomo and Fujiwara armies arrive.

00:16:20.530 --> 00:16:22.870
The History Retrograde Army isn't here.

00:16:23.650 --> 00:16:28.470
The people who killed my former 
master will be fighting soon.

00:16:28.470 --> 00:16:29.620
That's right.

00:16:30.650 --> 00:16:34.440
What's the matter, Imanotsurugi-san? 
Your face looks pale.

00:16:35.130 --> 00:16:37.930
He seems to be remembering the past.

00:16:38.290 --> 00:16:42.970
However, battle will lead 
us to our next phase.

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:45.100
This would be the perfect opponent.

00:16:46.220 --> 00:16:48.170
This awful feeling...

00:16:48.850 --> 00:16:50.470
This overwhelming bloodlust...

00:16:51.470 --> 00:16:53.680
They're close.

00:16:57.670 --> 00:16:58.910
A surprise attack!

00:17:02.370 --> 00:17:03.150
Are you okay?

00:17:03.630 --> 00:17:05.870
<i>For Imanotsurugi to get 
hit by a surprise attack...</i>

00:17:06.150 --> 00:17:08.540
Do not force yourself, Imanotsurugi!

00:17:08.680 --> 00:17:11.670
I leave supporting the back
to you and Iwatooshi!

00:17:14.820 --> 00:17:16.480
The enemy is also diverse?

00:17:16.670 --> 00:17:20.280
Fighting with a strong opponent is 
more than I could've hoped for.

00:17:20.280 --> 00:17:21.900
We must focus our energy!

00:17:21.900 --> 00:17:22.560
Right.

00:17:23.310 --> 00:17:24.070
Going forth.

00:17:26.110 --> 00:17:27.820
It's a battle!

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:32.270
Roar, my muscles!

00:17:33.780 --> 00:17:35.140
I will exorcise this evil!

00:17:35.320 --> 00:17:38.190
All right, I'm hunting, too!

00:17:38.520 --> 00:17:43.600
If those two will be here soon, then 
I can change Lord Yoshitsune's—

00:17:43.600 --> 00:17:44.880
You mustn't!

00:17:45.490 --> 00:17:47.960
Why can't we change history?!

00:17:48.110 --> 00:17:52.220
No matter what tragedy befalls us, 
we will be here afterward.

00:17:53.980 --> 00:17:55.140
But...

00:17:55.530 --> 00:17:59.570
<i>Imanotsurugi, I know how you feel.</i>

00:18:01.790 --> 00:18:05.840
<i>I, too, wanted to help Okita-kun.</i>

00:18:05.840 --> 00:18:11.450
<i>I thought only of Okita-kun 
for months at the citadel.</i>

00:18:12.340 --> 00:18:13.810
<i>But now things have changed.</i>

00:18:14.540 --> 00:18:19.240
<i>No matter how sad my past is, it is 
because of that past that I'm here now.</i>

00:18:20.160 --> 00:18:25.370
<i>Imanotsurugi, the one who is wielding
 you now isn't Minamoto no Yoshitsune,</i>

00:18:26.480 --> 00:18:27.620
<i>it's our Master!</i>

00:18:29.860 --> 00:18:31.120
Iwatooshi!

00:18:36.780 --> 00:18:38.210
Yamanbagiri-san!

00:18:38.940 --> 00:18:42.140
This enemy is unbeatable if you're being held captive by your past memories.

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:45.810
Fight with us, Imanotsurugi.

00:18:46.120 --> 00:18:47.250
With you?

00:18:48.940 --> 00:18:50.820
This is a tough situation, isn't it?

00:18:51.100 --> 00:18:55.490
Ka, ka, ka! This is a fine training.

00:18:55.890 --> 00:18:57.110
You seem to be having fun.

00:18:57.230 --> 00:18:58.820
That is because I...

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:02.270
...wish to become stronger,
so I can laugh off everything.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:04.780
How do you all...

00:19:05.210 --> 00:19:06.910
Because we've heard it tons of times.

00:19:09.300 --> 00:19:12.580
Become stronger, to laugh off everything?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:16.950
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka! Now, let's go!

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:24.290
My blade can even cut through stone!

00:19:27.130 --> 00:19:29.010
Am I frightening?

00:19:38.590 --> 00:19:39.560
Take that!

00:19:44.510 --> 00:19:48.330
I'll make you regret looking 
down on me because I'm a copy.

00:19:57.010 --> 00:19:58.790
Repent with your death!

00:19:59.360 --> 00:20:04.750
If I am inexperienced, it is because 
I am now far from my own mind!

00:20:11.660 --> 00:20:14.150
We are victorious, everyone!

00:20:14.420 --> 00:20:17.560
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka, ka!

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:20.660
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka, ka!

00:20:36.170 --> 00:20:38.110
Don't forget this day.

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.600
<b>Repair Room</b>

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.600
<b>1: Nakigitsune</b>

00:20:47.140 --> 00:20:48.600
<b>2: Ishikirimaru</b>

00:20:49.040 --> 00:20:53.890
For my brothers to have gone that far, 
the enemy must have been incredibly strong.

00:20:54.120 --> 00:20:56.800
But we won.

00:20:56.810 --> 00:21:01.110
I wish you could've seen 
Yamanbagiri's awakened form.

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:04.610
It was my first time
fighting with Yamanbagiri,

00:21:04.610 --> 00:21:07.740
but I didn't know he fought so gallantly.

00:21:08.070 --> 00:21:09.490
What was it like?

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:15.350
He's usually like, "I'm just a copy," 
with an expression like he's gathered up

00:21:15.350 --> 00:21:20.370
all the unhappiness in the world, 
but he was really cool in battle!

00:21:20.370 --> 00:21:21.670
He was.

00:21:22.480 --> 00:21:25.920
His hood fell off and we could see 
his blonde hair for once, and he said,

00:21:26.410 --> 00:21:29.880
"I'll make you regret looking 
down on me because I'm a copy."

00:21:30.040 --> 00:21:34.140
He punished them with his blade 
like lightning. It was really pretty.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.110
Don't call me pretty.

00:21:36.540 --> 00:21:38.070
I wish I could have seen it, too!

00:21:38.300 --> 00:21:40.540
Forget about me!

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:42.640
He's blushing.

00:21:43.690 --> 00:21:45.810
That's the first time 
I've seen you like that.

00:21:46.440 --> 00:21:49.110
Ka, ka, ka, ka, ka, ka!

00:21:54.720 --> 00:21:55.380
What is it?!

00:21:55.380 --> 00:21:56.160
What?

00:21:59.590 --> 00:22:00.560
Who is that?

00:22:01.110 --> 00:22:02.380
No idea.

00:22:02.950 --> 00:22:05.340
He is the super sword warrior.

00:22:06.300 --> 00:22:07.300
Super?

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:10.750
His name is Majirunrun Gokigenmaru.

00:22:14.550 --> 00:22:15.920
Maji?

00:23:54.990 --> 00:23:59.940
<b>More Hanamaru Next Week!</b>
